{"shortDescription":"Vivos Therapeutics entered twelve exchange agreements effective Aug 31, 2026 to convert an aggregate $2,861,270 of partitioned Streeterville notes into up to 11,445,080 common shares at prices at or above Nasdaq minimums. Issuances occur as shares become free trading and are limited by a 4.9% benef…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Vivos Therapeutics entered twelve exchange agreements effective Aug 31, 2026 to convert an aggregate $2,861,270 of partitioned Streeterville notes into up to 11,445,080 common shares at prices at or above Nasdaq minimums. Issuances occur as shares become free trading and are limited by a 4.9% beneficial ownership cap and a sell-down condition. The exchanges, done under Section 3(a)(9) with no cash proceeds, reduce the Streeterville Note balance to about $3.7 million and are intended to deleverage and strengthen the balance sheet."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Agreement 1: Vivos Therapeutics Swaps $238,995 Streeterville Note for Up to 955,980 Shares"]}]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Agreement type"]},": Debt-for-equity exchange agreement (Partitioned Note)"]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Counterparty"]},": Streeterville Capital"]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Signed / Effective"]},": Aug 31 2026 / Aug 31 2026"]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Duration / Termination"]},": At will"]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Reason"]},": Reduce debt and strengthen balance sheet"]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Agreement 2: Vivos Therapeutics Swaps $240,106 Streeterville Note for Up to 960,426 Shares"]}]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Agreement type"]},": Debt-for-equity exchange agreement (Partitioned Note)"]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Counterparty"]},": Streetervi